{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p003","chapter":5,"chapterTitle":"সমীকরণ","topic":"5.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৫.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৫.২","kind":"exercise","page":102,"text":"সমাধান করো:","verified":true,"reviewReasons":[]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p004","chapter":5,"chapterTitle":"সমীকরণ","topic":"5.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৫.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৫.২","kind":"exercise","page":102,"text":"১. $\\sqrt{x - 4} + 2 = \\sqrt{x + 12}$\n২. $\\sqrt{11x - 6} = \\sqrt{4x + 5} - \\sqrt{x - 1}$\n৩. $\\sqrt{2x + 7} + \\sqrt{3x - 18} = \\sqrt{7x + 1}$\n৪. $\\sqrt{x + 4} + \\sqrt{x + 11} = \\sqrt{8x + 9}$\n৫. $\\sqrt{11x - 6} = \\sqrt{4x + 5} + \\sqrt{x - 1}$\n৬. $\\sqrt{x^2 - 8} + \\sqrt{x^2 - 14} = 6$\n৭. $\\sqrt{x^2 - 6x + 9} - \\sqrt{x^2 - 6x + 6} = 1$\n৮. $\\sqrt{x - 2} - \\sqrt{x - 9} = 1$\n৯. $6\\sqrt{\\frac{2x}{x - 1}} + 5\\sqrt{\\frac{x - 1}{2x}} = 13$\n১০. $\\sqrt{\\frac{x - 1}{3x + 2}} + 2\\sqrt{\\frac{3x + 2}{x - 1}} = 3$","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
